# Only track top-level files/scripts that start with a number (the numbered
# analysis pipeline: 1a, 1b, 2a, 2ai, 2aii, 2aiii, 2b, 2c, 3a, ...).
# Everything else - docs, old scripts, virtualenvs, caches, data dirs, etc. -
# is ignored. (Covers the previous /dset/, /decoding, /.DS_Store entries too,
# since none of those start with a digit.)
/*
!/[0-9]*
!/.gitignore
